>how do I attack useing my weapons
As the other's said, press the "w" key to wield a weapon and step into
the other guy's square.  I believe the "F"  (not little "f") command
also works.

you can also hit two squares away if wielding a polearm and pressing
"a" for "apply".  "t" allows you to throw weapons, and "f" allows you
to fire arrows from a bow, crossbow bolts from a crossbow,  and rocks
from a sling.

Good luck!

Suggestion:  As many others have said, your character will live longer
the longer (s)he stays back from melee.  Have you read in the guidebook
about the word "Elbereth"?  

